@Shopera_HostAddress = http://localhost:5208
@AdminUserId = 1

# After creating "Computers", replace this with the returned categoryId.
@ParentCategoryId = 1

# After creating "Laptops", replace this with the returned categoryId.
@CategoryId = 2


### 1. Check that the backend is running
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/categories


### 2. List categories as Admin, including hierarchy and usage counts
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories
X-Admin-User-Id: {{AdminUserId}}


### 3. Create the root category: Computers
POST {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories
X-Admin-User-Id: {{AdminUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Computers",
  "description": "Computers, laptops, desktops, and related devices."
}


### IMPORTANT
# Run request 3 first.
# Copy the returned categoryId for "Computers".
# Set @ParentCategoryId at the top to that returned ID.


### 4. Create the child category: Laptops
POST {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories
X-Admin-User-Id: {{AdminUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Laptops",
  "description": "Portable laptop and notebook computers.",
  "parentCategoryId": {{ParentCategoryId}}
}


### IMPORTANT
# Run request 4 after updating @ParentCategoryId.
# Copy the returned categoryId for "Laptops".
# Set @CategoryId at the top to that returned ID.


### 5. Confirm public Seller-selectable categories
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/categories


### 6. Confirm the Admin category hierarchy
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories
X-Admin-User-Id: {{AdminUserId}}


### 7. Rename the Laptops category
PATCH {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories/{{CategoryId}}
X-Admin-User-Id: {{AdminUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Business Laptops",
  "description": "Portable computers intended for professional and business use.",
  "updateParentCategory": false
}


### 8. Move a category under Computers
PATCH {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories/{{CategoryId}}
X-Admin-User-Id: {{AdminUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "updateParentCategory": true,
  "parentCategoryId": {{ParentCategoryId}}
}


### 9. Make a category a root category
PATCH {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories/{{CategoryId}}
X-Admin-User-Id: {{AdminUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "updateParentCategory": true,
  "parentCategoryId": null
}


### 10. Delete a category
# Only run this after moving its child categories and products elsewhere.
DELETE {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/admin/categories/{{CategoryId}}
X-Admin-User-Id: {{AdminUserId}}